@startuml
title RPRRSBSI V4-2 Outpost Projection and Synchronization
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

node "AceOutpost" {
  database "Local projection" as Local
  queue "Scheduled work" as Work
  queue "Durable outbound envelopes" as Outbox
  component "Sync engine" as Sync
}
cloud "Intermittent network" as Network
node "Ace central service" {
  component "Versioned sync API" as Api
  database "Ace schema" as Ace
}

Work --> Local : atomic checkpoint
Local --> Outbox : stable operation + hash
Outbox --> Sync : pending until ack
Sync --> Network
Network --> Api
Api --> Ace : idempotent commit
Ace --> Api : durable result
Api --> Sync : acknowledgment
Sync --> Local : record ack

note bottom of Outbox
  Retry is idempotent.
  Absence is not deletion.
end note

note bottom of Local
  Selective projection, not full replica.
  Sensitive/non-sensitive boundary is enforceable.
end note
@enduml
